    <item>
      <title>Bug Hunt 2026 Wrap-Up - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACCF Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/01/bug-hunt-2026-wrap-up/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/01/bug-hunt-2026-wrap-up/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 03:11:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-14151" class="post-14151 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Bug Hunt 2026 Wrap-Up&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;On Sunday night, I attended the final fireworks festival of the year. Cube was there for the show too, and he told me that he normally prefers dumplings over fireworks&amp;#8230;but this particular night was an exception.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8635-sm.jpg" alt="Cube: Nine times outta 10, I'll choose dumplings over fireworks." class="wp-image-14152" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Hey, don&amp;#8217;t dump on fireworks.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Tortimer mentioned this being the last fireworks festival of 2026, and he said he hoped I always remember this summer. That kinda made me sad for some reason.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8636-sm.jpg" alt="Tortimer: Today is the last fireworks show of the year! I hope you remember this summer always, sprout." class="wp-image-14153" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I made my way around to Iggy&amp;#8217;s house, I saw that he was all packed up in boxes. I didn&amp;#8217;t have another chance to save him. That&amp;#8217;s too bad that his stay was so short; he didn&amp;#8217;t even last a month!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8637-sm.jpg" alt="Iggly: Hey... Hold up... Oh, yeah, I just remember I'm bailing out of this town!" class="wp-image-14154" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Your own boxes that you just packed didn&amp;#8217;t remind you?&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;After making my rounds, I went bug hunting during the fireworks. I played about an hour and a half, and the fireworks ended at midnight. It&amp;#8217;s always sad when the festival is over, especially the last one of the year.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8638-sm.jpg" alt="Tortimer: Well. I guess this is it for fireworks this year. No more fireworks until next year. How sad..." class="wp-image-14155" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But there was still one more night for bug hunting, so I played again last night (Monday, August 31st). Pecan wanted me to catch a crucian carp for her, which she called the hippest fish around. 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8640-sm.jpg" alt="Pecan: I'm usually the one to have the hippest fish around. But the latest trend slipped out of my grip somehow!" class="wp-image-14156" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But I didn&amp;#8217;t want to help out on a fishing request. My focus was on bug hunting! I again played for about an hour and a half, and I kept going until midnight&amp;#8230;when September began and most of the good bugs stopped appearing.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Today, I received Iggly&amp;#8217;s goodbye letter in the mail.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8641-sm.jpg" alt="'Sup, Jeff, This is it, my last day in Forest! Living here made me realize just how burly I really am. Tell everyone thanks for being so scrawny! From your bud, Iggly" class="wp-image-14157" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Okay, so now that peak bug hunting season has ended, let&amp;#8217;s talk about my summer goal. I ended June with 77,350,000 bells in savings, and my goal was to make 2.65 million by September 1st&amp;#8230;so that my savings would reach 80 million. But as I mentioned last week, I met that milestone just over a week ago.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But I still kept bug hunting in that final week of August, and I picked up the pace. I played several days, hitting 81 million during the final fireworks on Sunday night. But my final bug hunt (Monday night), combined with my latest bank interest and some fruit I sold to reach a nice round number, bumped my savings up to 81.5 million bells today.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8642-sm.jpg" alt="Your current balance is 81,500,000 bells." class="wp-image-14158" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;So I made 4.15 million bells over the summer, easily beating my goal of 2.65 million. It&amp;#8217;s less than what I made last year, but I&amp;#8217;d still consider it a success. It&amp;#8217;s still going to take me a few more years to save up 100 million and earn that green feather, though. 😆&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Did any of you have summer bug hunting goals, in any Animal Crossing game? If so, let me know how it went in the comments! And I&amp;#8217;ll be back with another entry next week&amp;#8230;when we&amp;#8217;ll see who replaces Iggly. Never Stop Crossing!&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/01/bug-hunt-2026-wrap-up/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-01T23:11:23-04:00"&gt;September 1, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-01T23:15:24-04:00"&gt;September 1, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8635-sm.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Dud Prize - Jeff&amp;#039;s New Leaf Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/08/31/dud-prize/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/08/31/dud-prize/</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 02:27:14 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-18734" class="post-18734 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Dud Prize&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Last night, I attended the final fireworks festival of the year. My villagers were mesmerized by them. 🎆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0055.jpg" alt="Molly: Ooooh! Aaaah!" class="wp-image-18735" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0056.jpg" alt="Marina: The fireworks are so pretty, aren't they? Watching them always fills me with so many different emotions." class="wp-image-18736" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0054.jpg" alt="Aurora: They really are quite mesmerizing. I can't look away in case I miss one!" class="wp-image-18737" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;But you&amp;#8217;re looking away right now!&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;At the event plaza, Isabelle gave me a flower bopper&amp;#8230;which I promptly put on. I also bought a cookie from Crazy Redd. Unfortunately, it contained a dud prize.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0062.jpg" alt="Redd's Cookie: Too bad! You got a dud prize." class="wp-image-18739" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0063.jpg" alt="Redd: Whoa! Well, that's too bad...! This is a losing ticket." class="wp-image-18738" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;He sells me a dud, and then acts surprised.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But at least he gave me a sparkler as a consolation prize.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0067.jpg" alt="Jeff sets off a sparkler between Isabelle and Crazy Redd during the fireworks festival." class="wp-image-18740" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Tonight, Hornsby asked me to deliver a gift (a common chair) to Marina. She loved the chair, and she rewarded me with a pink pj shirt. That reward actually sounds like &lt;em&gt;her &lt;/em&gt;style, not mine. But thanks anyway, Marina. 😛&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260831_HNI_0072.jpg" alt="Marina: It's a pink pj shirt! I really hope you like it." class="wp-image-18741" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Boots asked me to catch an ocean fish for him&amp;#8230;&lt;em&gt;any &lt;/em&gt;ocean fish. So I went and caught the first fish I saw. And of course, you know that was a sea bass. 😆 I wouldn&amp;#8217;t exactly say he was thrilled with it, but he accepted it.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260831_HNI_0074.jpg" alt="Boots: Hey! Now that is a healthy-looking sea bass! Thanks!" class="wp-image-18742" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He rewarded me with a rally tank.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I found a lost item (a bag) on the ground near the plaza, and I eventually returned it to its owner, Inkwell. He said it was his &amp;#8220;all-purpose bag of workouty goodness.&amp;#8221;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260831_HNI_0077.jpg" alt="Inkwell: Pop some rocks in it, tie it to your shoe...and POW! Buff ankles!" class="wp-image-18743" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Do you even &lt;em&gt;have &lt;/em&gt;ankles?&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He rewarded me with a coconut, which doesn&amp;#8217;t sound like the most exciting reward. But I suppose I should be &lt;em&gt;shell&lt;/em&gt;-ebrating. 😛&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I&amp;#8217;m sad to see fireworks season and bug season ending. But autumn is just around the corner! See you next time! 🍂&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/08/31/dud-prize/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-08-31T22:27:14-04:00"&gt;August 31, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-08-31T22:33:44-04:00"&gt;August 31, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260830_HNI_0055.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Villagers Calling Me Fat - Jeff&amp;#039;s Animal Crossing Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/2026/08/30/villagers-calling-me-fat/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/2026/08/30/villagers-calling-me-fat/</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:36:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-6226" class="post-6226 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Villagers Calling Me Fat&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;On Wednesday, I found a goodbye letter from Murphy in the mail. Not to sound rude, but I&amp;#8217;m just glad it wasn&amp;#8217;t Kiki that moved out! (Kiki is one of my favorites, of course.)&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-murphy-out2026-sm.jpg" alt="Dear Jeff, Well, my streak continues... I just can't seem to settle down in any town for long. This is kind of odd, because I've said so many goodbyes, but this one actually hurts... Goodbye... -Murphy" class="wp-image-6228" sizes="(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Puck was telling me about the ability to connect a Game Boy Advance to a GameCube, which makes a boat appear. He seemed really excited about it for some reason. 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-puck-boat1-sm.jpg" alt="Puck: ...to a Nintendo GameCube and then go to the dock, you can ride on a boat! A boat, I tell you! A boat!" class="wp-image-6229" sizes="(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He said he wants to go for a boat ride and let his fingers dangle in the water. But he doesn&amp;#8217;t even &lt;em&gt;have &lt;/em&gt;fingers!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-puck-boat2-sm.jpg" alt="Puck: I want to go for a boat ride, brrrrrrrrr! I want to lie back and let my fingers dangle in the water!" class="wp-image-6230" sizes="(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I found a new &lt;em&gt;(play)&lt;/em&gt; house next door to Maple, and Peewee the gorilla was inside. I&amp;#8217;m not a fan of gorillas (except for Louie, of course). But welcome to Forest anyway, Peewee. Enjoy your (hopefully) short stay.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-peewee2026-sm.jpg" alt="Peewee: Hey! Who are you? I certainly don't know you!" class="wp-image-6231" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Shortly after I caught a purple butterfly, Sydney took notice of it. And she did it in a way that made use of her catchphrase. 😛&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-sydney-wings-sm.jpg" alt="Sydney: Wow, it's in pretty good shape, with wings! I've never seen anything like it!" class="wp-image-6232" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;She offered me 1,050 bells for the purple butterfly, but I declined. That&amp;#8217;s only about half of what Tom Nook will pay.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I played again today, and Kiki offered to sell me a tartan rug or a stone wall for 5,000 bells. Yikes! &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-kiki-some-stone-sm.jpg" alt="Kiki: Well, lucky for you, I've got a tartan rug and some stone wall with me." class="wp-image-6233" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some &lt;/em&gt;stone wall?&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-kiki-5k-sm.jpg" alt="Kiki: I'll let you buy either one for 5,000 bells, kittycat!" class="wp-image-6234" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;That&amp;#8217;s a lot of money, especially when neither one of them is rare. No thanks, kitty cat.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Puck told me that he was so starving that he was going to flip his wig!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-puck-wig-sm.jpg" alt="Puck: I'm starving, brrrrrrrrr! If I don't get some food in me, I'm gonna flip my wig! I'm so serious right now!" class="wp-image-6235" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But surprisingly, he wasn&amp;#8217;t asking me for food. That was just part of his dialogue. He continued on the topic of food though. He called me fat, and he told me to watch my snack intake. However, he said &lt;em&gt;he&amp;#8217;s&lt;/em&gt; able to eat whatever he likes because he hides his weight with his clothes! &lt;em&gt;Ha!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-puck-weight-sm.jpg" alt="Puck: Me? I hide my weight with my clothes, so I can eat whatever, whenever, brrrrrrrrr! Ka-ching!" class="wp-image-6236" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Your clothes aren&amp;#8217;t fooling anyone, Puck.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I spoke with Baabara, she too called me fat. She gave me some advice as well, except hers was &lt;strong&gt;much &lt;/strong&gt;more specific:&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="450" height="346" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-baa-hashbrowns-sm.jpg" alt="Baabara: Never ever EVER eat hash browns after 9:00 at night, unless you WANT to get fat!" class="wp-image-6237" sizes="auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;No hash browns after 9 p.m.? I guess that&amp;#8217;s when the potatoes hit the sack. 🥔&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;A few weeks ago, I posted my latest Animal Crossing GameCube Moments video, #30! Here it is if you haven&amp;#8217;t seen it yet:&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"&gt;&lt;div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper"&gt; &lt;iframe loading="lazy" title="Animal Crossing - GameCube Moments #30" width="660" height="371" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lH6UqPzgBWQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;September is right around the corner, and that means it&amp;#8217;s almost the &lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/guides/ac/september-fishing.htm"&gt;best time of year&lt;/a&gt; for fishing! I plan on doing some ocean fishing in the first part of the month, especially if I can catch a rainy day for some coelacanths! Happy fishing if you decide to participate as well!&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/2026/08/30/villagers-calling-me-fat/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-08-30T22:36:05-04:00"&gt;August 30, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-08-30T22:37:24-04:00"&gt;August 30, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ac-murphy-out2026-sm.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Wasted Fruit - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACWW Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/08/29/wasted-fruit/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/08/29/wasted-fruit/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 03:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-8984" class="post-8984 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Wasted Fruit&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	 	 	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Mom sent me a letter today, talking about a fruit-only diet. She encouraged me to try it (she sent a cherry attached to the letter). In the spirit of her letter, I decided to eat the cherry instead of selling it. I don&amp;#8217;t need the 500 bells that badly, after all.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/mom-fruit-letter.jpg" alt="Dear Jeff, Have you heard of the fruit-only diet? You can eat as much as you want and not gain an ounce! You should try it! -Mom" class="wp-image-8985" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But moments later, I realized something. Forest doesn&amp;#8217;t have any cherry trees! That may have been my first cherry, and I usually try to plant my first one of each foreign fruit so that I&amp;#8217;ll have at least one tree of each type. Forest doesn&amp;#8217;t have any cherry trees or peach trees. Oops! Well, maybe I&amp;#8217;ll get another one someday. 😆&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I visited Derwin, and he asked if I could make my house a little more cool. That&amp;#8217;s kind of rude&amp;#8230;but I suppose I could ask the same of him!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/derwin-cool.jpg" alt="Derwin: Don't you think you could make your house a little more...cool?" class="wp-image-8987" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Next, I visited Chief. He asked me to guess how he was feeling, and I guessed that was he was doing fine. That was correct, apparently because he just ate a bunch of garlic? 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/chief-garlic.jpg" alt="Chief: Well, I did just eat a bunch of garlic." class="wp-image-8988" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;The smell of victory is in the air.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;For answering correctly, he rewarded me with a pep squad shirt.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;The last fireworks festival of the year was held tonight, and Tortimer gave me a sparkler.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/tortimer-last.jpg" alt="Tortimer: Tonight's the last Fireworks Show of the summer, sprout!" class="wp-image-8991" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Frobert wasn&amp;#8217;t taking the news very well about tonight being the last fireworks show of the summer.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/frobert-fw1.jpg" alt="Frobert: What?! Today's the last day of the Fireworks Show?!" class="wp-image-8989" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He even said his life is meaningless without colorful explosions! Wow.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/frobert-fw2.jpg" alt="Frobert: But my life is meaningless without colorful explosions, fribbit.." class="wp-image-8990" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Fortunately, fireworks don&amp;#8217;t force K.K. Slider to cancel his show in this game. (I&amp;#8217;m looking at you, New Horizons.) So I went down to the Roost, and the singing dog performed &amp;#8220;K.K. Ska&amp;#8221; for me.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/kk-82926.jpg" alt="K.K.: All right, get ready to dig the riffs on this ditty: K.K. Ska!" class="wp-image-8992" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Over at town hall, I found a red bar shirt in the recycle bin. After that, I wrapped up my game for the night.&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0ff365ea4b4ae589e18c26b092fe26946a6e14116b63065f41029c8c6138c7c8?s=98&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g' class='avatar avatar-49 photo' height='49' width='49'/&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/08/29/wasted-fruit/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-08-29T23:58:00-04:00"&gt;August 29, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-08-30T01:04:35-04:00"&gt;August 30, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt; &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/mom-fruit-letter.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Macaroons for a Goat? - Jeff&amp;#039;s New Horizons Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/08/29/macaroons-for-a-goat/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/08/29/macaroons-for-a-goat/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 03:33:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-9666" class="post-9666 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Macaroons for a Goat?&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Last Sunday night, I again attended the fireworks festival. Bones wanted to watch the fireworks with me. Aww, he&amp;#8217;s so cute! Of course I will, Bones!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bones-watch-sm.jpg" alt="Bones: Tonight's fireworks show just started. Wanna watch it together?" class="wp-image-9667" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I spoke with Isabelle, she gave me another star bopper&amp;#8230;the same one as the week before! You know, the same one I was still wearing. 😛 Thanks anyway, Isabelle.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Yesterday, Static was telling me about some macaroons he got from his neighbor. Hmm, I wonder which neighbor it was (because they didn&amp;#8217;t give me any)! 😛&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/static-macaroons-sm.jpg" alt="Static: Anyway, I got these macaroons from my neighbor the other day." class="wp-image-9669" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Static told me he was going to feed the macaroons to a goat (until he tried them himself). But I can&amp;#8217;t get over the goat thing. Why on earth would he give them a goat? Why not give some to me? And which goat would it be, anyway? Forest doesn&amp;#8217;t have any goats!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/static-goat-sm.jpg" alt="Static: I was gonna feed 'em to a goat or somethin', but I took a tiny bite... and the darn things are delicious!" class="wp-image-9668" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;It was a weird conversation. So I walked out, and guess what I saw right by Static&amp;#8217;s house? &lt;em&gt;A goat!&lt;/em&gt; It was Nan, who was in town as a tourist.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/nan-tourist-sm.jpg" alt="Nan: It's a short stay, but I intend to make the most of it, kid!" class="wp-image-9670" sizes="auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;&amp;#8230;by eating my macaroons!&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;With summer on its way out, I spent nearly half an hour catching bugs tonight.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/elephant2026-sm.jpg" alt="I caught a horned elephant! I think it's too small to ride..." class="wp-image-9672" sizes="auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I caught several rare ones, more semi-common ones, and three sharks as well.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Here are a few other quick notes from this week:&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;ul class="wp-block-list"&gt; &lt;li&gt;On Monday night, K.K. Slider performed &amp;#8220;K.K. Sonata&amp;#8221; for me, Bones, Agent S, Peanut, and Merengue. I enjoyed the show. 🙂&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;On Tuesday, I sold 17 bugs to Flick for 148,500 bells. Peak bug season only has a few days left, and I&amp;#8217;m going to miss it.&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Tonight, K.K. Slider performed &amp;#8220;K.K. Lament&amp;#8221; for me. Even though Peanut, Louie, and June were seated before I spoke with K.K., they all got up and left me alone.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/08/29/macaroons-for-a-goat/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-08-29T23:33:00-04:00"&gt;August 29, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-08-30T00:10:29-04:00"&gt;August 30, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bones-watch-sm.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>80 Million Bells - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACCF Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/08/28/80-million-bells/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/08/28/80-million-bells/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 03:55:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-14144" class="post-14144 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;80 Million Bells&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Last Sunday night, I again participated in the fireworks festival. I shot down this balloon present and the screenshot almost made it look like the firework popped the balloon. (Or maybe that&amp;#8217;s a stretch, but I still thought it looked cool.)&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RUU_8631-sm.jpg" alt="Shooting down a balloon present." class="wp-image-14146" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;A koopa shell was inside.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;During my session, I officially met my summer goal, earning 2.65 million since July 1st. Why such an odd number? Because the objective was to get my savings balance to 80 million bells, and I&amp;#8217;ve now done that.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RUU_8632-sm.jpg" alt="Your current balance is 80,000,000 bells." class="wp-image-14147" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Of course, that hasn&amp;#8217;t stopped my bug hunting. I continued to play this week, and I&amp;#8217;m going to play this weekend as well.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;On Tuesday night, Willow noticed a giant beetle in my pockets, and she said it made me look less handsome!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RUU_8633-sm.jpg" alt="Willow: Oh, I know! It's that giant beetle you have! Somehow you look less handsome carrying it!" class="wp-image-14148" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;She was wanting to give me an upright piano for it, but I declined the trade offer.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Tonight, Cube asked me to catch an olive flounder for him.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RUU_8634-sm.jpg" alt="Cube: The thing is, I really need an olive flounder to round out my chapter on deep-frying..." class="wp-image-14149" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Once I did, he rewarded me with 720 bells.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Iggly has been telling me he&amp;#8217;s planning on moving out of town. I&amp;#8217;ve told him to stay, but so far he hasn&amp;#8217;t changed his mind. So he may or may not be gone by next week.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I went bug hunting for about 90 minutes tonight, and I earned over 300k. I&amp;#8217;m planning on two more bug hunts, Sunday during fireworks, and then again on Monday night for the last hurrah. I&amp;#8217;ll be back next week with my final bug hunting totals.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I posted my latest City Folk Moments video this week, so please check it out if you haven&amp;#8217;t seen it yet:&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"&gt;&lt;div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper"&gt; &lt;iframe loading="lazy" title="Last-Second Delivery, Does it Count? / City Folk Moments #34 (Animal Crossing ACCF)" width="660" height="371" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VBW50F27TGU?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/08/28/80-million-bells/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-08-28T23:55:00-04:00"&gt;August 28, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-08-29T01:34:52-04:00"&gt;August 29, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
